      "id": "claim_f4ce22ecb5c143f9987929c7ad448e8c",
      "statement": "main.py is the FastAPI application exposing POST /ask (retrieval-augmented chat over the shared Chroma store, with fuzz-based Greek region boosting) and POST /agent (delegating to the LangGraph agent from agent.py with a fixed thread_id), using gemini-2.5-flash and CORS for http://localhost:3000.",
